<b>Gamushara ni te o nobashita</b>

00:18.710 --> 00:22.020
<b>Kotae o tsukitsukete</b>

00:22.020 --> 00:27.460
<b>Nani o te ni iretemo manzoku
suru koto wa nai</b>

00:28.660 --> 00:34.600
<b>Fukuzatsu ni karanda kokoro no
sukima kara nigedase</b>

00:34.600 --> 00:36.670
<b>Sou sa, make a treasure</b>

00:36.670 --> 00:41.900
<b>Sabitsuita toki no naka ni kimi no koe o kiku</b>

00:41.900 --> 00:44.940
<b>Kono mama todoketai</b>

00:44.940 --> 00:48.210
<b>Hikari no naka kimi ga matteru</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:51.810
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

00:51.810 --> 00:55.480
<b>Ima sugu ni</b>

01:06.030 --> 01:08.060
<b>Dakara, make a treasure</b>

01:08.060 --> 01:13.300
<b>Sabitsuita kagami no naka jibun o sagashite</b>

01:13.300 --> 01:16.400
<b>Kono te de tsukamitai</b>

01:16.400 --> 01:19.640
<b>Doko ni itemo kimi ga matteru</b>

01:19.640 --> 01:23.210
<b>Sou shinjiteru kara</b>

01:23.210 --> 01:25.870
